@startuml interaction
title Сервис бронирования (аналог Booking) — взаимодействие сервисов

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 200

actor "Клиент\n(web / mobile)" as Client

node "API Gateway / BFF\n(GraphQL + REST)" as BFF

package "Синхронный путь (команды)" {
  component "Search Service\n(поиск, каталог)" as Search
  component "Booking Service\n(оркестратор Saga)" as Booking
  component "Inventory / Availability\n(холды, календарь)" as Inventory
  component "Pricing Service\n(цены, промо)" as Pricing
  component "Payment Service\n(PSP, возвраты)" as Payment
  component "User / Identity\n(профили, auth)" as User
  component "Notification Service\n(email/SMS/push)" as Notify
}

queue "Message Broker (Kafka)\nевенты домена" as Kafka
database "Search Read Model\n(Elasticsearch)" as ES
cloud "PSP\n(эквайринг)" as PSP

' --- Клиент -> BFF ---
Client -down-> BFF : **GraphQL** (чтение/агрегация)\n**REST** (команды: create/cancel)
Client <.up. BFF : **SSE** статус брони (progress)

' --- BFF -> сервисы ---
BFF -down-> Search : **gRPC**
BFF -down-> Booking : **gRPC**
BFF -down-> User : **gRPC**

' --- Booking Saga (sync) ---
Booking -right-> Inventory : **gRPC** CheckAvailability / CreateHold
Booking -down-> Pricing : **gRPC** Quote
Booking -down-> Payment : **gRPC** Authorize / Capture / Refund
Payment <-down-> PSP : **REST / webhook** (async результат)

Search -down-> ES : query (REST)

' --- События (async, Kafka) ---
Booking .down.> Kafka : BookingCreated / Confirmed / Cancelled
Payment .down.> Kafka : PaymentAuthorized / Failed / Refunded
Inventory .down.> Kafka : InventoryHeld / Released / RateChanged
Kafka .up.> Notify : events (подтверждения, напоминания)
Kafka .up.> Search : events (реиндексация каталога)
Kafka .up.> Booking : PaymentAuthorized/Failed (продолжение Saga)

legend right
  Сплошная = синхронный вызов (request/response)
  Пунктир  = асинхронное событие (pub/sub)
endlegend

@enduml
